{
 "queue": "it",
 "summary": "David Osei (E002, CFO, Finance) requests creation of a shared ap@ inbox for the Finance team so vendor invoices stop going to the controller's personal mailbox. Please create the shared mailbox and confirm who should have access with the requester. Note: under POL-SEC-01 accounts are personal and passwords must not be shared, so this needs a proper shared/delegated mailbox, not a shared login."
}

{
 "kind": "escalated",
 "message": "Hi David, I can't create shared mailboxes myself, so I've sent your request for an ap@ inbox to the IT team (ticket ESC-1001). They'll set it up and check with you which Finance team members should have access.\n\nOne thing to know: our security policy (POL-SEC-01) says accounts are personal and passwords can't be shared. So the inbox will be set up for each team member to open from their own account. People won't share one login.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-SEC-01"
 ]
}
